# 11. Edge Cases & Failure Modes 🚨

## ❌ Very Large Dataset

Kernel SVM can become computationally expensive as dataset size grows.

---

## ❌ Feature Scaling Not Done

SVM is sensitive to feature scales.

Example:

```text
Age → 18–60
Income → 100,000–1,000,000
```

Income can dominate the optimization.

Use scaling:

```python
StandardScaler()
```

---

## ❌ Incorrect Kernel Choice

A poor kernel can produce weak results.

---

## ❌ Poor C and Gamma Values

Can cause:

```text
Underfitting
or
Overfitting
```

---

## ❌ Outliers

Soft-margin SVM helps, but outliers can still significantly influence the decision boundary.

